(Python Directed Graph Project Documentation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview) Tj
T*
(This project implements a directed graph with integer edge costs and a console-based user) Tj
T*
(interface.) Tj
T*
(The application supports loading/saving graphs from files, graph editing operations, random) Tj
T*
(graph generation,) Tj
T*
(querying graph properties, and making/restoring a backup copy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Project Structure) Tj
T*
(- src/main.py) Tj
T*
(  Program entry point. Loads a graph from graph.txt and starts the console menu.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- src/domain/DirectedGraph.py) Tj
T*
(  Core graph model.) Tj
T*
(  Stores:) Tj
T*
(  - _outbound: dictionary vertex -> set of outbound neighbors) Tj
T*
(  - _inbound: dictionary vertex -> set of inbound neighbors) Tj
T*
(  - _costs: dictionary \(u, v\) -> edge cost) Tj
T*
(  - _vertices, _edges counters) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- src/service/GraphIO.py) Tj
T*
(  File input/output utilities.) Tj
T*
(  - readGraph\(fileName\): reads graph from text file) Tj
T*
(  - writeGraph\(fileName, graph\): writes graph in the same format) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- src/service/randomGraphMaker.py) Tj
T*
(  Random graph generator.) Tj
T*
(  - makeRandomGraph\(vertices, edges, minCost, maxCost\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- src/UI/menu.py) Tj
T*
(  Console menu that exposes graph operations to the user.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. DirectedGraph API) Tj
T*
(- isEdge\(u, v\): bool) Tj
T*
(  Checks if edge u -> v exists.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- addEdge\(u, v, cost\): None) Tj
T*
(  Adds edge if missing; raises ValueError if already present.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- removeEdge\(u, v\): None) Tj
T*
(  Removes existing edge; raises ValueError if edge is missing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- addVertex\(\): int) Tj
T*
(  Adds a new vertex and returns its identifier.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- removeVertex\(vertex\): None) Tj
T*
(  Removes vertex and all incident edges.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- setEdgeCost\(u, v, cost\): None) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
