(  Updates edge cost for an existing edge.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- getEdgeCost\(u, v\): int) Tj
T*
(  Returns edge cost; requires edge to exist.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- copyGraph\(\): DirectedGraph) Tj
T*
(  Deep-copies graph internals \(neighbor sets and costs map\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- parseVertices\(\): list[int]) Tj
T*
(  Returns sorted list of existing vertex ids.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- parseOutboundNeighbors\(vertex\): list[int]) Tj
T*
(  Returns sorted outbound neighbors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- parseInboundNeighbors\(vertex\): list[int]) Tj
T*
(  Returns sorted inbound neighbors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- getOutDegree\(vertex\), getInDegree\(vertex\): int) Tj
T*
(  Degree queries for a vertex.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- getVertices\(\), getEdges\(\), getCosts\(\)) Tj
T*
(  Access graph counters and edge-cost map.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. File Format) Tj
T*
(Graph files are text files with this format:) Tj
T*
(- First line: "<number_of_vertices> <number_of_edges>") Tj
T*
(- Next E lines: "<start_vertex> <end_vertex> <cost>") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example:) Tj
T*
(4 5) Tj
T*
(0 1 10) Tj
T*
(0 2 4) Tj
T*
(1 3 7) Tj
T*
(2 3 1) Tj
T*
(3 0 9) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Console Menu Operations) Tj
T*
(The menu supports:) Tj
T*
(1. Load graph from file) Tj
T*
(2. Save graph to file) Tj
T*
(3. Generate random graph) Tj
T*
(4. Show graph summary) Tj
T*
(5. List all vertices) Tj
T*
(6. Inspect a vertex \(degrees + neighbors\)) Tj
T*
(7. Check whether an edge exists) Tj
T*
(8. View an edge cost) Tj
T*
(9. Update an edge cost) Tj
T*
(10. Add a vertex) Tj
T*
(11. Remove a vertex) Tj
T*
(12. Add an edge) Tj
ET
endstream
