T*
(6. Validation and Error Handling) Tj
T*
(- Invalid vertex ids produce ValueError.) Tj
T*
(- Invalid edge access \(missing edge\) produces ValueError.) Tj
T*
(- Adding an existing edge produces ValueError.) Tj
T*
(- readGraph rejects empty files and truncated edge lists.) Tj
T*
(- Random generator validates negative counts, invalid cost ranges,) Tj
T*
(  and edge counts above vertices * vertices.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Running the Application) Tj
T*
(From pythonProject directory:) Tj
T*
(python -m src.main) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(By default, src/main.py tries to load graph.txt and then opens the interactive menu.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Notes) Tj
T*
(- Self-loops are allowed because random generation and edge insertion accept u == v.) Tj
T*
(- Vertices are identified by integers.) Tj
T*
(- Vertex IDs are not reindexed after deletion; addVertex uses max\(existing\) + 1.) Tj
ET
endstream
